{"nodes": [{"id": "recovered_request_2_to_original_works_seed_laws_and_14d_request_2_seed_laws_and_14d", "label": "Request 2 \u2014 do the seed laws bear on the fourteenth axis?", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "recovered/REQUEST-2-to-original-works-seed-laws-and-14D.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A confirmation question: the attractive links here are mostly false, so the value is in the distinction, and a clean 'no load-bearing link' is a fully acceptable answer."}, {"id": "recovered_request_2_to_original_works_seed_laws_and_14d_seed_laws_t1_t2_t3_p4", "label": "The seed laws T1, T2, T3 and P4", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/REQUEST-2-to-original-works-seed-laws-and-14D.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "T1 is a generation criterion, T2 an alphabet law proved without a cap, T3 an envelope-step law, and P4 locates non-uniqueness: the lattice has no extreme points yet the seed is seven, a maximal failure of the combinatorial Krein-Milman property."}, {"id": "recovered_request_2_to_original_works_seed_laws_and_14d_fourteenth_axis_14d", "label": "14D \u2014 the fourteenth axis, bounded without being built", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/REQUEST-2-to-original-works-seed-laws-and-14D.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fill falls by law so the sequence converges and the limit lies in a bracket, but its value does not follow; the reconstruction never produces a coordinate, so only the direction can be bounded from inside."}, {"id": "recovered_request_2_to_original_works_seed_laws_and_14d_empty_index_necessary_not_sufficient", "label": "The empty index: E(X)=0 is necessary for completeness, not sufficient for content", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/REQUEST-2-to-original-works-seed-laws-and-14D.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The null index passes every closure test, so what distinguishes a real index is its join-irreducibles and surplus, not closure."}], "edges": [{"source": "recovered_request_2_to_original_works_seed_laws_and_14d_request_2_seed_laws_and_14d", "target": "recovered_request_2_to_original_works_seed_laws_and_14d_seed_laws_t1_t2_t3_p4", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/REQUEST-2-to-original-works-seed-laws-and-14D.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_request_2_to_original_works_seed_laws_and_14d_request_2_seed_laws_and_14d", "target": "recovered_request_2_to_original_works_seed_laws_and_14d_fourteenth_axis_14d", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/REQUEST-2-to-original-works-seed-laws-and-14D.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_request_2_to_original_works_seed_laws_and_14d_empty_index_necessary_not_sufficient", "target": "recovered_request_2_to_original_works_seed_laws_and_14d_fourteenth_axis_14d", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/REQUEST-2-to-original-works-seed-laws-and-14D.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_request_2_to_original_works_seed_laws_and_14d_empty_index_necessary_not_sufficient", "target": "recovered_request_2_to_original_works_seed_laws_and_14d_seed_laws_t1_t2_t3_p4", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/REQUEST-2-to-original-works-seed-laws-and-14D.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}